    "Quiet blink retains neutral body curve/placement closely. Greet/aha/cheer now communicate head tilt/attention with existing anatomy; left/right are naturally drawn directions. Species pair subtly changes one continuous S curve, with body-center placement rather than fictitious tail-foot support.",
    "All seven static decoded sequence rows inspected in both mattes. The limited three-pose remake resolves the actual prior fin-count finding while retaining the six good old frames."
  ],
